{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDic8AXXPki3W8eTEdJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017nMEHRCtbA7HRM6jj6yG1b","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261104-221655__x61bd7e/work/WiiStork*/ && cat > game/data/poses.js <<'EOF'\n// Held poses: a clip, a window in seconds and the way the body faces. Add a row; the Pose Viewer in Dev Mode prints new ones.\nwindow.G.POSES = {\n  stork:    { clip: '111_39_part1', a: 3.6, b: 7.0, tgt: 1.57 },\n  kneelift: { clip: '111_39_part2', a: .5,  b: 2.4, tgt: 1.57 },\n  triangle: { clip: '111_39_part3', a: 2.2, b: 5.2, tgt: 1.2 },\n  warrior:  { clip: '111_39_part3', a: 6.6, b: 7.6, tgt: 1.57 },\n  lunge:    { clip: '111_38_part1', a: 2.9, b: 5.0, tgt: .25 },\n  dog:      { clip: '111_38_part2', a: 2.8, b: 5.2, tgt: .25 },\n  fold:     { clip: '111_38_part2', a: 8.0, b: 8.8, tgt: .25 },\n  plank:    { clip: '111_41_part3', a: 3.4, b: 6.4, tgt: .25 }\n};\n// the five poses of Sun Flow, in order\nwindow.G.FLOW = ['lunge', 'dog', 'triangle', 'warrior', 'stork'];\nEOF\ncat > game/data/lines.js <<'EOF'\n// All the words. Add a line to a bank and it is used; no code change.\nwindow.G.LINES = {\n  tare: {\n    hello: ['Oh! Feet. Good morning, feet.', 'You came back. I wasn\\'t worried. I was just standing here, on the floor, where I live.', 'It has been one day since you last stepped on me. I counted it twice to be sure.', 'Hello again. I did not move. I cannot move. It was a good day for it.', 'Good morning. I have been rehearsing that for hours.'],\n    still: ['Please stand still. Stiller. That was the wrong way.', 'Stand like a tower. A tower that is thinking.', 'Hold very still. I am doing my best not to wobble too.'],\n    lean: ['You lean beautifully. Like a tower people visit.', 'You put more weight on your left foot. Your right foot has noticed.', 'You lean like someone who is about to say something.', 'A fine lean. I would frame it, but I have no walls.'],\n    number: ['I am not allowed to say whether this is good. It is a number.', 'Numbers are only numbers. That one is mine now.', 'Let\\'s call it a number and leave it there.'],\n    fav: ['You are my favorite. You are also my only.', 'I have a favorite. Do not look behind you.'],\n    absence: ['It has been {n} days. I kept your spot warm. I am not able to generate heat.'],\n    paused: ['You paused. That\\'s {n} times today. I\\'m not counting. {n}.'],\n    idle: ['Are you still there? I can feel you not standing on me.', 'Hello? I can hear a lot of nothing. It sounds like you.', 'Still there? I have started to count the tiles.'],\n    star0: ['You finished. Some people don\\'t. Those people are probably at lunch.', 'That was not your best. I\\'m saying that with love, and also as data.', 'Zero stars is a very round number. I like it.'],\n    star1: ['Good effort! I could tell it was effort.', 'One star! It is very bright when you hold it close.', 'Good. A solid first star. The rest are on their way.'],\n    star2: ['Well done. I felt that. In a good way. Mostly.', 'Two stars. I would have said three, but I am a scale and we are cautious.', 'That was lovely. I may need a moment.'],\n    star3: ['You barely moved. For a moment I thought you had left me. Please don\\'t do that.', 'Three stars. I did not know there were that many.', 'Perfect. I have nothing to add, so I will add this.'],\n    fall: ['You fell. That\\'s okay. The floor was expecting you.', 'You fell. The floor says hello.', 'Oh. That was the floor. It likes you.'],\n    quit: ['Leaving early? That\\'s fine. I will just file this under \\'Thursday.\\'', 'Quitting is just stopping, with extra steps. It\\'s fine.'],\n    night: ['Sleep well. I\\'ll be out here. In the dark. Being accurate.', 'Good night. I will keep the floor warm. I cannot. But I will think about it.'],\n    gerald: ['Gerald has swallowed your minutes. He looks pleased. He always looks like that. He\\'s ceramic.'],\n    gentle: ['Gentle Mode is on. I won\\'t tell anyone. I don\\'t know anyone.'],\n    held: ['Let\\'s call it {n}. It doesn\\'t go higher. It\\'s not allowed.', 'Your Spine Age is {n}. It has not moved. Neither have I. We have that in common.'],\n    age: ['Your Spine Age is {n}. That\\'s younger than yesterday! Your spine has been through a lot.'],\n    ageUp: ['Your Spine Age is {n}. It is older than yesterday. Spines do that. It is nobody\\'s fault.'],\n    ageSame: ['Your Spine Age is {n}. That is also what it was. It is very consistent.'],\n    early: ['Bed already? It is still the same day. I checked.', 'Going to bed early. That is also a kind of exercise. I am not sure which.'],\n    tips: ['Tip: Drink water. Your body is mostly water. The rest is opinions.', 'Tip: If you can\\'t touch your toes, bring your toes closer.', 'Tip: Stretch before bed. Or after bed. Or in bed. I am not in your bed.', 'Tip: Sitting is just standing with fewer steps.', 'Tip: A deep breath is free. Shallow ones are on sale.', 'Tip: Your posture is how your spine says hello.', 'Tip: If a stair surprises you, say thank you and go on.', 'Tip: Do not look at the floor. It knows.'],\n    suggest: ['Today I suggest the one with the star. It is my favorite mat. I have not said that out loud before.', 'The mat with the star is my suggestion. I put it there. I do not have hands. It was difficult.'],\n    plateau: ['We call this the plateau. It is on the map. You cannot go around it.'],\n    drop: ['It moved! It moved a lot, all at once. I wanted you to have it.'],\n    recal: ['Three grams. It\\'s the feelings. They\\'re dense.'],\n    nudge: ['Oh. You nodded at Gertrude. She nodded back. That was a lot of nodding.'],\n    reading: ['Today you weigh {n} ducks. That is a normal number of ducks.', 'You weigh {n} ducks today. They are all very polite ducks.', 'Today you weigh {n} ducks. I counted them twice. They did not mind.'],\n    welcome: ['You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement. The card isn\\'t signed. It only says: \\'You know why.\\'']\n  },\n  birch: { hello: ['Welcome. I am Birch. I\\'m made of wood, so I will be very patient and slightly warped.'], breathe: ['Breathe in. ...I don\\'t breathe. But I\\'ve read about it, and it sounds very good.'], back: ['Keep your back straight. Mine was sanded.'], hold: ['Nice. Now hold that until it stops being nice.'], shake: ['You\\'re shaking. This means it\\'s working. Or you\\'re cold.'], more: ['Two more. I said that two reps ago. It is still true.'], demo: ['Watch me. Then do it better, and tell no one.', 'Like this. Slowly. Slowness is mostly patience with a hat on.', 'I will show you once. I have shown the wall many times.'], praise: ['Good. Very good. I will tell the others. There are no others.', 'That was fine work. I could not do it, but I approve.'] },\n  alder: { hello: ['Hello! I\\'m Alder. I was a tree, and then I was a lot of very small decisions.'], breathe: ['Wonderful! You\\'re doing so well. Please stop shaking.'], back: ['Everybody\\'s body is different. Yours is the one wobbling.'], hold: ['Let\\'s hold this for a moment. A moment is eleven seconds.'], shake: ['Smile. It relaxes the jaw. ...Not like that.'], more: ['This next pose is the Stork. I knew a stork. We didn\\'t speak.', 'Two more! I love two. It is my second favorite number.'], demo: ['Watch me! Then do it, and I will clap, in my head.', 'Like this! Lovely. I am so proud of me.', 'One more look. Then it\\'s all you. And a little bit me.'], praise: ['Wonderful! I felt my branches lift!', 'You are doing so well! Please keep going, I\\'ve told everyone.'] },\n  gertrude: ['You\\'re doing fine, dear. I\\'ve been standing here since Thursday.', 'I\\'m eighty-seven. My spine is nineteen. We don\\'t really talk.', 'Well done, dear. I\\'ve been waiting since Thursday.', 'I used to be taller. Now I am more of a middle.'],\n  dennis: ['I\\'m only here for the blender. Don\\'t tell the scale.', 'Olive?', 'I don\\'t exercise. I am the reason other people can.', 'Is it a glass? Is it a tray? Both. Olive?'],\n  marisol: ['Morning! I\\'ve already done today. I\\'m on to tomorrow.', 'I did the island twice before you woke. Once for each leg.', 'Pace yourself! I will wait. By running in place.'],\n  kevin: ['Everybody calls me Young Kevin. There was an older Kevin. We don\\'t talk about how he got so flexible.', 'I am fifty-two. Everything here is older.'],\n  okafor: ['A hoop is just a circle that believes in you.', 'Spin it like you mean it. Then like you do not. Then like you do.'],\n  lou: ['I\\'m on a five-minute break. It\\'s been a good one. Three years in March.', 'Zzz. Stretch. Zzz.'],\n  twins: ['We\\'re not related.', 'We\\'ve checked.', 'We do everything together. Except we do not.'],\n  candle: ['Did you lock the door?', 'What is a lumbar?', 'Is that my knee?', 'Dennis.', 'You left the stove on in 2014.', 'Who sent that card?', 'Am I breathing right now?', 'Now I\\'m breathing on purpose.', 'Olive?'],\n  boot: ['Zeroing the scale', 'Sanding the instructors', 'Counting the ducks', 'Telling the hippo'],\n  questions: [['Have you recently sat?', 'Yes', 'Define recently', 'Fine. Recently is a long time.'], ['Do stairs ever surprise you?', 'Often', 'Only the last one', 'The last one surprises everyone. It is built to.'], ['Do you make a small noise when you stand up?', 'Yes', 'No (this is a lie)', 'I heard it. It is a nice noise. It has a lot of feelings.'], ['On a scale of one to me, how do you feel?', 'One', 'Me', 'That is a very good answer. I did not write it.'], ['When did you last look at your feet?', 'Just now', 'I\\'d rather not', 'They\\'re doing fine. They have been waiting.']],\n  arrival: ['You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement.', 'The card isn\\'t signed. It only says: \\'You know why.\\'', 'Motto: Gently, Or Not At All.', 'Please choose someone to stand near you for five days.'],\n  endingA: ['I should tell you something. The card.', 'The one that wasn\\'t signed. That was me.', 'I don\\'t have hands. It took three years.', 'I sent one to everybody. You\\'re the one who came.', 'Now step off. Go on. I\\'ll be here.', 'I\\'m a scale. That\\'s the whole job.'],\n  endingByAge: { low: 'Gertrude gives you the hat. It is her spare. It is also a promise.', mid: 'Your spine has stopped asking questions.', high: 'Come back. Please. I mean that in a wellness way.' },\n  signs: ['You Have Been Doing That Wrong', 'Gently, Or Not At All', 'Please Do Not Walk On The Laundry Line. Walking On The Laundry Line: 10:30 Daily.', 'Posture Is A Verb', 'Hydrate Or Reflect'],\n  regulars: { gertrude: 'Gertrude', dennis: 'Dennis', marisol: 'Marisol', kevin: 'Young Kevin', okafor: 'Mr. Okafor', lou: 'Lou', twins: 'The Twins' },\n  duelEvents: ['A gull has arrived. It has opinions.', 'Dennis has turned on the blender.', 'A conga line is passing through the raft.', 'Fireworks. Please be gentle with them.', 'Tare is singing. It is a song about a floor.', 'A goose. We do not know why.'],\n  slalomTimes: ['Gertrude 0:58. She walked.', 'Marisol 0:41. She did it twice.', 'Dennis 1:40. He did not go.', 'Lou 3:00. Still counting.'],\n  goalByDay: ['Orientation: do one thing, gently.', 'Improvement: get 2 stars today.', 'The Plateau: nothing will happen. Do it anyway.', 'Tare\\'s Day: step on the scale. Be kind.', 'The Gentle Games: the last day. Be here for it.']\n};\nG.line = (bank, rng, vars) => { const b = bank; let s = Array.isArray(b) ? b[Math.floor((rng || Math.random)() * b.length)] : String(b); if (vars) for (const k in vars) s = s.split('{' + k + '}').join(vars[k]); return s; };\nG.tareSay = (key, vars) => G.line(G.LINES.tare[key] || ['...'], null, vars);\nEOF\necho ok"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1