last look at your feet?', 'Just now', 'I\\'d rather not', 'They\\'re doing fine. They have been waiting.']],\n  arrival: ['You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement.', 'The card isn\\'t signed. It only says: \\'You know why.\\'', 'Motto: Gently, Or Not At All.', 'Please choose someone to stand near you for five days.'],\n  endingA: ['I should tell you something. The card.', 'The one that wasn\\'t signed. That was me.', 'I don\\'t have hands. It took three years.', 'I sent one to everybody. You\\'re the one who came.', 'Now step off. Go on. I\\'ll be here.', 'I\\'m a scale. That\\'s the whole job.'],\n  endingByAge: { low: 'Gertrude gives you the hat. It is her spare. It is also a promise.', mid: 'Your spine has stopped asking questions.', high: 'Come back. Please. I mean that in a wellness way.' },\n  signs: ['You Have Been Doing That Wrong', 'Gently, Or Not At All', 'Please Do Not Walk On The Laundry Line. Walking On The Laundry Line: 10:30 Daily.', 'Posture Is A Verb', 'Hydrate Or Reflect'],\n  regulars: { gertrude: 'Gertrude', dennis: 'Dennis', marisol: 'Marisol', kevin: 'Young Kevin', okafor: 'Mr. Okafor', lou: 'Lou', twins: 'The Twins' },\n  duelEvents: ['A gull has arrived. It has opinions.', 'Dennis has turned on the blender.', 'A conga line is passing through the raft.', 'Fireworks. Please be gentle with them.', 'Tare is singing. It is a song about a floor.', 'A goose. We do not know why.'],\n  slalomTimes: ['Gertrude 0:58. She walked.', 'Marisol 0:41. She did it twice.', 'Dennis 1:40. He did not go.', 'Lou 3:00. Still counting.'],\n  goalByDay: ['Orientation: do one thing, gently.', 'Improvement: get 2 stars today.', 'The Plateau: nothing will happen. Do it anyway.', 'Tare\\'s Day: step on the scale. Be kind.', 'The Gentle Games: the last day. Be here for it.']\n};\nG.line = (bank, rng, vars) => { const b = bank; let s = Array.isArray(b) ? b[Math.floor((rng || Math.random)() * b.length)] : String(b); if (vars) for (const k in vars) s = s.split('{' + k + '}').join(vars[k]); return s; };\nG.tareSay = (key, vars) => G.line(G.LINES.tare[key] || ['...'], null, vars);\nEOF\necho ok"}}}
