{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018UU8RxmmMWA89pz55zsy4F","type":"tool_result","content":"837:- `flow.dir(x, y, fx, fy)`: normalized ground direction to walk from (x, y) toward the target (straight at it where the field doesn't reach)\n838:- `flow.next(x, y)` †: the next cell to head for from (x, y): { x, y, z (its center and top), kind: 'walk' | 'climb' | 'drop' | 'jump', edge (how far (x, y) is from the side of its cell it leaves by) }, or null where the field doesn't reach (or at the target). An AI standing on the ground presse\n839:- `flow.update(x, y)`: aim the field at a world point, or at several (update([[x, y], ...]): each cell leads to the nearest, the heroes a horde chases); it rebuilds only when a target's cell or the map (map.version) changes. A map.solid shape standing on the floor raises the cells under it to it\n856:- `E.tex.grass(x, y, o = {})`: grass with darker tufts and a few flowers. o: { base, dark, light, flower } hex colors\n857:- `E.tex.plain(x, y, o = {})`: plain color with light noise, for roads, carpets and space floors. o: { base, amount }\n858:- `E.tex.planks(x, y, o = {})`: wooden floor boards running along x. o: { base, dark, line }\n859:- `E.tex.water(x, y, o = {})`: water with static ripple lines (baked, so it does not move). o: { base, dark, light }","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1eb76a49-6bce-4550-b1b7-5878361cc243","uuid":"54174f15-8159-4f13-9029-44e13d92defe","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:46:26.915Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"837:- `flow.dir(x, y, fx, fy)`: normalized ground direction to walk from (x, y) toward the target (straight at it where the field doesn't reach)\n838:- `flow.next(x, y)` †: the next cell to head for from (x, y): { x, y, z (its center and top), kind: 'walk' | 'climb' | 'drop' | 'jump', edge (how far (x, y) is from the side of its cell it leaves by) }, or null where the field doesn't reach (or at the target). An AI standing on the ground presse\n839:- `flow.update(x, y)`: aim the field at a world point, or at several (update([[x, y], ...]): each cell leads to the nearest, the heroes a horde chases); it rebuilds only when a target's cell or the map (map.version) changes. A map.solid shape standing on the floor raises the cells under it to it\n856:- `E.tex.grass(x, y, o = {})`: grass with darker tufts and a few flowers. o: { base, dark, light, flower } hex colors\n857:- `E.tex.plain(x, y, o = {})`: plain color with light noise, for roads, carpets and space floors. o: { base, amount }\n858:- `E.tex.planks(x, y, o = {})`: wooden floor boards running along x. o: { base, dark, line }\n859:- `E.tex.water(x, y, o = {})`: water with static ripple lines (baked, so it does not move). o: { base, dark, light }","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018UU8RxmmMWA89pz55zsy4F","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
