({...})` in a new file in `activities/` and add it to the file list in `build.mjs`. It becomes a scene, appears in Free Play and the attract playlist once it is listed in `scenes/attract.js` and, if it needs a mat, in `G.ISLAND.mats`.\nEOF\necho done"}}}
