{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjMhWdAh8kdxUbggfd1S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I restored both plan values. The final build passes the full `node tests/run.mjs all` run: 693 passed, 0 failed (rules, play, half, browser, hub).\n\n- **Laundry Line:** the Lean set is back to the plan's `s 16, A 3.5`. The plan's rope band check passes again, so I put its original expected values back. To make the rope finishable I added two tuning changes:\n  - **Calmer y axis:** the sideways axis is calmed inside the activity only.\n  - **Shorter course:** spans are shorter, with posts every 3 m.\n- **Stork Stand tier 2:** the star thresholds are back to the plan's 35/65/90%. Eyes Closed was too hard for the expert bot, so I shrank how far the ring jumps between spots (`ringR` .17 → .05) instead of lowering the stars. The expert bot now earns 2 stars on every seed, and good gets 1.\n- **PROGRESS.md:** I replaced the deviation note with this.\n\nThe audio is still checked only through analysers and an offline render, and nobody has listened to it. The controller is only a stubbed pad. I can't change either on this computer.\n\nThe game file, `exit-interview.json` and `PROGRESS.md` are in the work folder. The Source Information and the three feedback sections are in my first reply and on the About screen."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":179,"cache_read_input_tokens":534647,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":179},"output_tokens":440,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1eb76a49-6bce-4550-b1b7-5878361cc243","uuid":"b90272f0-9008-479e-93d2-ca140eb3da19","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:06:19.644Z","request_id":"req_011CgjMhWHaRJ7npLH3Did4W"}
