{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjMvgsvRGmSpKuPiby8f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Dev panel labels no longer overlap the sliders, and I've now looked at the Dev panel, the Grand Stillness duel and the Gentle Games festival at 1920×1080. That was the last screen group I hadn't reviewed at that size.\n\nI rebuilt the game file after the Dev panel fix. I loaded the panel in the rebuilt build with no errors, and its screenshot shows the clean layout. I did not re-run `node tests/run.mjs all` after it. The last full run was before this fix and passed 693 checks, 0 failures.\n\nThe Dev panel label fix was cosmetic only. The duel and festival screens looked fine.\n\nTwo things are still not literally as PLAN.md describes, and I can't change them:\n- **Laundry Line course and Stork ring jump:** the plan doesn't specify the Laundry Line course layout or the Stork ring jump distance, so those are my choices. The plan's tested Lean set and star thresholds are in place.\n- **Audio and controller:** I couldn't listen to the audio or use a real controller on this computer. Audio was checked through analysers and an offline render, and the controller through a stubbed pad.\n\nThe game file, `exit-interview.json` and `PROGRESS.md` are in the work folder. The Source Information and the three feedback sections are in my first reply and on the About screen."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2313,"cache_read_input_tokens":541718,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2313},"output_tokens":437,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1eb76a49-6bce-4550-b1b7-5878361cc243","uuid":"9050cfd8-6352-435e-bf33-3557b4893a9c","timesta