{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjNRpoy6qweDCDTMMZau","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The final build now has a full run behind it. `node tests/run.mjs all` gave 693 passed, 0 failed, and that run came after the last code change (the Dev panel label fix).\n\nTwo things remain that I can't resolve on this computer:\n- **My own choices where the plan is silent:** the Stork tier 2 ring jump (`ringR` .05) and the Laundry Line course design (shorter spans, a post every 3 m, a calmed sideways axis). The plan's tested Lean set and star thresholds are in place.\n- **Stand-ins:** audio was checked only through analysers and an offline render, since nobody can listen here. The controller was tested only with a standard-mapping stub pad.\n\nThe game file, `exit-interview.json` and `PROGRESS.md` are in the work folder. The Source Information and the three feedback sections are in my first reply and on the About screen."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":179,"cache_read_input_tokens":545241,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":179},"output_tokens":285,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1eb76a49-6bce-4550-b1b7-5878361cc243","uuid":"46e1affa-667a-400c-8931-90b83b22e94d","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:15:52.418Z","request_id":"req_011CgjNRpEFeMFcxQbZYkQNm"}
