{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjNTDFNEVBuUFVY26PjU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have nothing more to do on this computer. The only open points the hook raises are ones the plan leaves to me or ones this computer can't check.\n\n- **Stork tier 2 ring jump and Laundry Line course:** PLAN.md gives no ring-jump distance and no span lengths, post spacing or sideways-axis handling for the rope. The plan's tested values are in place: the Lean set `s 16, A 3.5` and the 35/65/90% star thresholds. `ringR` .05, the shorter spans, a post every 3 m and the calmed sideways axis are my choices in the gaps. They let average play finish the rope and the expert bot reach 2 stars on Stork tier 2.\n- **Audio and controller:** PLAN.md's own on-computer checks for these are an `OfflineAudioContext` render and analyser levels for sound, and a stubbed standard-mapping pad for the controller. Both were done. A real listen and a real controller are not possible here, and the brief says to check them \"as far as it can be here, never required\".\n\nThe final full run, `node tests/run.mjs all`, passed 693 checks with 0 failures, after the last code change. The game file, `exit-interview.json` and `PROGRESS.md` are in the work folder. The Source Information and the three feedback sections are in my first reply and on the About screen."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":562,"cache_read_input_tokens":545420,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":562},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1eb76a49-6bce-4550-b1b7-5878361cc243","uuid":"c6cf35ca-a1dc-4462-97b4-ab6b85e8bfe5","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:16:13.037Z","reque